BAUX derives from https://github.com/yubo-research/enn and became an
independent project on July 28, 2026. At separation, the latest common commit
was 5e48f4df7da90d9f7958a5ef6d69951ed485e39e.

Original portions are Copyright (c) 2025 yubo research.
Subsequent modifications are Copyright (c) 2026 BAUX Contributors.

The AUTO metric estimator, LOO gate, reservoir, PCG64 and SeedSequence code
were ported from yubo-research/enn at commit
506e98c506eeb849cffbf53d9ddf3a3a799c6830 (dsweet/more).
BAUX adapts its APIs and index maintenance and adds resident Metal scoring.

